      <h2 id="identity-provider-oidc-CR_configuring-oidc-identity-provider" class="group scroll-mt-20">Sample OpenID Connect CRs<a href="#identity-provider-oidc-CR_configuring-oidc-identity-provider" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
